      "id": "claim_2b986e6a60644a8d822ed863353d56ce",
      "statement": "The shared domain (packages/shared) owns the protocol envelope, roles, browser presence and capability list, auth/presence payloads, tab-listing and file-upload/download/fetch message shapes, the adapter-driven BrijioBackgroundController, pure-DOM page-context/page-content/content-handler/batch-handler logic, page-reader adapter interfaces, bridge-settings normalization, timers, popup helpers, and logger; its public surface is re-exported from a single barrel at packages/shared/src/index.ts, and it is depended on by both server and extension code.",
