    {
      "id": "claim_97500588193a4647a435210306cc0f07",
      "statement": "The WebSocket relay (servers/websocket) authenticates each connection with a pairing token, derives a SHA-256 scopeKey from the token so token-sharing parties see one another's presence, routes MCP requests to a selected browser, correlates extension responses back to the originating MCP socket by message id, and holds presence and pending requests only in runtime memory that is cleared on socket close; it re-exports envelope creators/guards/parseBrijioEnvelope from @brijio/shared and routes messages without inspecting payloads.",
