      "statement": "The MCP server (servers/mcp) is the agent-facing surface: mcp-server.ts builds an McpServer registering read/action/download/fetch/screenshot tools, current-page-context and paginated current-page-content resources, one skill resource per skills directory, and a brijio-context prompt; tool modules reach browsers via the WebSocket client (websocket-client.ts, authenticated as the mcp role), HTTP serving uses the streamable HTTP transport (http-server.ts) with index.ts as entrypoint, and operational commands live in daemon.ts, doctor.ts, print-config.ts, and demo-server.ts; skill markdown is served from servers/mcp/skills.",
