      "statement": "The product/business framing domain (README.md, docs/project/POSITIONING.md, docs/project/CAPABILITY_MATRIX.md, docs/project/ROADMAP.md) positions Brijio around existing authenticated browser sessions, privacy, and explicit control rather than generic browser automation, and the capability matrix is the canonical product contract listing every tool/resource/prompt/skill with status, browser support, and intentionally unsupported behaviors (no cookie export, no session cloning, no continuous streaming, no credential extraction).",
